1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Hey…

2
00:00:02,028 --> 00:00:03,660
are you still awake?

3
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,420
I know you
are angry.

4
00:00:06,508 --> 00:00:08,380
You are
allowed to be.

5
00:00:09,164 --> 00:00:11,900
I said things
I didn't mean…

6
00:00:11,948 --> 00:00:15,040
because I was scared
you'd leave first.

7
00:00:15,596 --> 00:00:18,300
And that wasn't
fair to you.

8
00:00:19,084 --> 00:00:21,016
I didn't
text because…

9
00:00:21,036 --> 00:00:23,560
typing "sorry"
felt too small.

10
00:00:25,036 --> 00:00:27,000
I'm really sorry.

11
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,520
Can we talk
tomorrow?

12
00:00:30,092 --> 00:00:31,500
Not to fix
everything…

13
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,060
just to talk.

14
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:34,640
Please…

15
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,020
please don't go
to sleep angry,

16
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,180
okay?

